 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Cloud Map API (2017-03-14). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Only HTTP namespaces are stored: no Route 53 hosted zone, DNS record, health check, service or instance exists, and CreatePrivateDnsNamespace, CreatePublicDnsNamespace, CreateService, RegisterInstance and DiscoverInstances return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Namespace creation, update and deletion finish before the response. Each returns a new OperationId that names no stored operation; GetOperation and ListOperations return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501, so use ListNamespaces to find a new namespace's Id. ServiceCount stays 0. ListNamespaces refuses Filters. Update requester IDs are accepted but not recorded. Validation failures detected by the simulator are reported as ValidationException, not the official InvalidInput code.",
  "title": "AWS Cloud Map (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-03-14"
 },
